<title>POLAND: Indykpol Q3 net rises to PLN 1.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Indykpol Q3 net rises to PLN 1.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indykpol SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q3 1996     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				2.73   vs    1.47</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  1.93   vs    1.03</p>
<p>    net					1.14   vs    0.65</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Olsztynskie Zaklady Drobiarskie Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     41.90   vs   29.18</p>
<p>    costs of sales			39.13   vs   27.68</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.78   vs    0.19</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.18   vs    0.17</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.98   vs    0.81</p>
<p>    investment			     1.57   vs    0.95</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating				6.07   vs    3.35</p>
